(Japanese: '''ミカ''' ''Mika'') is a main character who appeared in [[Daisuki ♥ Pocket Monsters]]. She is a friend of [[Chloe]] and goes to the same school as her. Mika aims to become a {{pkmn|Trainer}} and catch all cute {{OBP|Pokémon|species}} in the {{pkmn|world}}, though her attempts to befriend them often get her in trouble.

